flowchart TB
    Start([User Login]) --> InputCreds["Enter Username<br/>& Password"]
    InputCreds --> Validate{Credentials<br/>Valid?}
    
    Validate -->|Invalid| Error["Show Error"]
    Error --> InputCreds
    
    Validate -->|Valid| Check{2FA<br/>Enabled?}
    
    Check -->|No| Session[Create Session]
    Check -->|Yes| SendOTP[Send OTP]
    SendOTP --> VerifyOTP[User Enters OTP]
    VerifyOTP --> CheckOTP{OTP Valid?}
    CheckOTP -->|No| SendOTP
    CheckOTP -->|Yes| Session
    
    Session --> Dashboard[Redirect to Dashboard]
    Dashboard --> End([Login Success])
